sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    actor Owner as SME Owner
    participant Web as GeM Saathi Web App
    participant Session as Session and Resume Service
    participant Calc as Rules and Calculation Engine
    participant Data as Benchmark and Content Store
    participant Events as Funnel Event Service
    participant GeM as Official GeM Portal

    rect rgb(18, 19, 18)
        Note over Owner,Events: Awareness and referral attribution
        Owner->>Web: Open partner or direct link
        Web->>Session: Start session with referral code and language
        Session-->>Web: Anonymous session ID and saved state
        Web->>Events: Record awareness_started
        Owner->>Web: Complete the short GeM 101 module
        Web->>Events: Record awareness_completed
        Web-->>Owner: Offer Eligibility Checker or direct tool access
    end

    rect rgb(60, 56, 47)
        Note over Owner,Events: Eligibility and classification
        Owner->>Web: Enter business, GST, Udyam and offering details
        Owner->>Web: Enter turnover, investment and prior experience
        Web->>Calc: Evaluate inputs with active rule version
        Calc->>Data: Load classification and eligibility rules
        Data-->>Calc: Versioned rules and guidance
        Calc-->>Web: Classification, verdict, reasons and missing items
        Web->>Session: Save answers and eligibility result
        Web->>Events: Record tool_completed for eligibility

        alt Eligible
            Web-->>Owner: Show Yes and recommend Revenue Estimator
        else Partially eligible
            Web-->>Owner: Show gaps, fix times and potential after fixing
        else Not currently eligible
            Web-->>Owner: Show reason, resource and save-and-return option
        else Not interested in government sales
            Web->>Events: Record disqualified_by_choice
            Web-->>Owner: Exit gracefully with awareness resources
        end
    end

    rect rgb(29, 24, 45)
        Note over Owner,Events: Financial tools and combined report
        Owner->>Web: Select category, city and optional turnover
        Web->>Calc: Estimate category revenue
        Calc->>Data: Read dated category and buyer benchmarks
        Data-->>Calc: Values, sources, ranges and caveats
        Calc-->>Web: Annual range, order value and procurement frequency

        opt Owner checks pricing
            Owner->>Web: Enter input costs, overheads and desired margin
            Web->>Calc: Calculate viable price and competitive margin
            Calc-->>Web: Price range, margin and L1 explanation
        end

        Owner->>Web: Open ROI and Effort Calculator
        Web->>Session: Load existing answers and completed results
        Session-->>Web: Reusable financial context
        Web->>Calc: Calculate costs, payback and 1-year and 3-year ranges
        Calc-->>Web: ROI result with assumptions and rule version
        Web->>Session: Save combined personalized report
        Web->>Events: Record report_viewed and registration_intent
        Web-->>Owner: Show report, sources and recommended next step
    end

    rect rgb(23, 42, 38)
        Note over Owner,GeM: Readiness and action
        Owner->>Web: Open Onboarding Readiness Tracker
        Web->>Session: Pre-fill checklist from eligibility answers
        Session-->>Web: Completed documents and saved progress
        Web-->>Owner: Show current step, time and common mistakes
        Owner->>Web: Mark a step complete
        Web->>Session: Persist checklist progress
        Owner->>Web: Choose Register on GeM
        Web->>Events: Record registration_cta_clicked
        Web-->>GeM: Open official registration deep link
        Owner->>Web: Return and confirm registration
        Web->>Events: Record registration_claimed for verification
    end
